{% doc %}
  @prompt
    IMPORTANT:
    - Do NOT include the human/person shown in the reference image.
    - The section should be designed specifically for a plant nursery / plant e-commerce website.
    - All plant/product images must be selectable through Shopify's Theme Editor using image upload/picker options.
    - Do NOT hardcode image URLs.
    - Make the section fully responsive for desktop, tablet and mobile.
    
    SECTION LAYOUT:
    
    1. MAIN SECTION
    - Full-width horizontal section.
    - Use a soft warm cream/off-white background.
    - Add a subtle decorative abstract radial/sunburst shape in the background on the right side.
    - Keep the overall design clean, premium and modern.
    - Rounded corners where appropriate.
    
    2. PRODUCT CAROUSEL
    Create a horizontally scrollable product carousel on the left/middle area.
    
    Display 3 plant product cards at a time on desktop.
    
    Each product card should contain:
    
    TOP AREA:
    - Large product image.
    - Image must be selectable/uploadable from Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Image should automatically fit inside the image area without distortion.
    - Rounded top corners.
    - Bestseller badge at top-left.
    - Discount badge at top-right.
    
    PRODUCT DETAILS:
    - Small rating badge such as:
      ★ 4.8 | 440
    - Product title.
    - Short product description.
    - Current price.
    - Original price with strikethrough.
    - Discount percentage.
    - Circular dark-green Add to Cart icon/button at bottom-right.
    
    Example content:
    Product 1:
    Title: Peace Lily Plant
    Description: Stunning air-purifying plant
    Price: ₹299
    Original Price: ₹350
    Discount: 15% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 440
    
    Product 2:
    Title: Anthurium Red Plant
    Description: Long-lasting indoor plant
    Price: ₹699
    Original Price: ₹800
    Discount: 13% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 111
    
    Product 3:
    Title: Jade Mini Plant
    Description: Easy-care lucky succulent
    Price: ₹249
    Original Price: ₹300
    Discount: 17% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 414
    
    3. SHOPIFY CUSTOMIZATION OPTIONS
    
    In the Shopify Theme Editor, provide settings for each product card:
    
    - Product image upload/picker
    - Product title
    - Product description
    - Current price
    - Original price
    - Discount text
    - Bestseller badge ON/OFF
    - Bestseller text
    - Rating
    - Review count
    - Product link
    - Add to cart button
    - Card background color
    
    Allow at least 6 product cards to be added dynamically using Shopify blocks.
    
    Each block should have its own image picker.
    
    4. CAROUSEL FUNCTIONALITY
    
    - Desktop: show 3 cards.
    - Tablet: show 2 cards.
    - Mobile: show 1 card with part of the next card visible.
    - Add a circular dark-green right arrow button overlapping the carousel.
    - Add a left arrow as well, but keep it subtle.
    - Smooth horizontal sliding animation.
    - Touch/swipe support on mobile.
    - Do not use external carousel libraries.
    - Use lightweight JavaScript/CSS.
    - Infinite or smooth looping is preferred.
    - Disable arrows when there are no more slides if infinite looping is not used.
    
    5. DESIGN STYLE
    
    Use a premium nursery / botanical visual style.
    
    Colors:
    - Dark green: #1F5130
    - Yellow/golden accent: #FFD60A
    - Cream background: #FFF9E8
    - White product card: #FFFFFF
    - Muted gray for secondary text.
    
    Typography:
    - Product titles should have a slightly elegant serif style.
    - Descriptions and prices should use a clean modern sans-serif font.
    - Use responsive font sizes.
    
    6. IMAGE SETTINGS
    
    VERY IMPORTANT:
    Every product card must have a Shopify image picker.
    
    Example schema structure:
    
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "product_image",
      "label": "Plant Image"
    }
    
    The uploaded image should be displayed dynamically.
    
    Also provide an optional image picker for:
    - Background/decorative plant image
    - Optional promotional image
    
    Do NOT use the human image from the reference.
    
    7. HOVER EFFECT
    
    When the user hovers over a product card:
    - Slightly lift the card.
    - Add a subtle shadow.
    - Plant image should have a very subtle zoom effect.
    - Add-to-cart button can slightly scale.
    - Keep the animation smooth and premium.
    - Do not make the animation excessive.
    
    8. ADD TO CART
    
    The circular shopping-bag/cart button should work with Shopify's cart functionality.
    
    If the block is connected to a Shopify product:
    - Clicking the button should add the selected product to cart.
    - Use Shopify's product/variant information.
    - If necessary, provide a product selector in the Theme Editor.
    
    Provide:
    - Product selector
    - Variant support
    - Add-to-cart functionality
    
    9. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop:
    - 3 product cards visible.
    - Cards should have equal width.
    - Carousel occupies approximately 65–70% of the section.
    - Leave enough breathing space around the cards.
    
    Mobile:
    - One card visible at a time.
    - Horizontal swipe carousel.
    - Product cards should remain visually large.
    - Hide unnecessary decorative elements.
    - Keep prices and buttons easy to tap.
    - No horizontal page overflow.
    
    10. CODE REQUIREMENTS
    
    Generate a complete Shopify Online Store 2.0 section.
    
    Provide:
    - Liquid
    - HTML
    - CSS
    - JavaScript
    - Shopify schema
    
    The code must be placed in ONE Shopify section file.
    
    Make sure:
    - Shopify Liquid syntax is valid.
    - Section sche, 11. ADDITIONAL PLANT PRODUCT CONTENT
    
    Include these 3 additional product cards in the carousel:
    
    PRODUCT 4:
    - Plant Name: The China Doll Plant - XL
    - Description: Evergreen ornamental indoor plant
    - Current Price: ₹1,499
    - Original Price: ₹1,800
    - Discount: 17% OFF
    - Rating: 4.9
    - Reviews: 38
    - Badge: BESTSELLER
    - Product Image: Shopify image picker
    
    PRODUCT 5:
    - Plant Name: Areca Palm Plant XL
    - Description: Tropical plant, purifies air
    - Current Price: ₹1,499
    - Original Price: ₹1,800
    - Discount: 17% OFF
    - Rating: 4.9
    - Reviews: 33
    - Badge: BESTSELLER
    - Product Image: Shopify image picker
    
    PRODUCT 6:
    - Plant Name: Bird of Paradise Plant - XL
    - Description: Bold tropical indoor centrepiece
    - Current Price: ₹2,499
    - Original Price: ₹3,000
    - Discount: 17% OFF
    - Rating: 4.8
    - Reviews: 12
    - Badge: BESTSELLER
    - Product Image: Shopify image picker
    
    
    12. COMPLETE PRODUCT DATA
    
    The carousel should support all 6 products:
    
    1. Peace Lily Plant
       - Stunning air-purifying plant
       - ₹299
       - ₹350
       - 15% OFF
       - Rating 4.8
       - 440 reviews
       - BESTSELLER
    
    2. Anthurium Red Plant
       - Long-lasting indoor plant
       - ₹699
       - ₹800
       - 13% OFF
       - Rating 4.8
       - 111 reviews
       - BESTSELLER
    
    3. Jade Mini Plant
       - Easy-care lucky succulent
       - ₹249
       - ₹300
       - 17% OFF
       - Rating 4.8
       - 414 reviews
       - BESTSELLER
    
    4. The China Doll Plant - XL
       - Evergreen ornamental indoor plant
       - ₹1,499
       - ₹1,800
       - 17% OFF
       - Rating 4.9
       - 38 reviews
       - BESTSELLER
    
    5. Areca Palm Plant XL
       - Tropical plant, purifies air
       - ₹1,499
       - ₹1,800
       - 17% OFF
       - Rating 4.9
       - 33 reviews
       - BESTSELLER
    
    6. Bird of Paradise Plant - XL
       - Bold tropical indoor centrepiece
       - ₹2,499
       - ₹3,000
       - 17% OFF
       - Rating 4.8
       - 12 reviews
       - BESTSELLER
    
    
    13. PRODUCT CARD CONTENT STRUCTURE
    
    Each card must visually follow this hierarchy:
    
    [ BESTSELLER ]                         [ 17% OFF ]
    
                 PLANT IMAGE
    
    [ ★ 4.9 | 38 ]
    
    The China Doll Plant - XL
    
    Evergreen ornamental indoor plant
    
    ₹1,499  ₹1,800                    [ 🛍 ]
    
    The cart icon should be circular and dark green.
    
    The original price must have a light gray strikethrough.
    
    The discount badge should be red with white text.
    
    The Bestseller badge should be yellow with dark text.
    
    The rating badge should be positioned overlapping or immediately below the image area.
    
    
    14. IMAGE UPLOAD REQUIREMENT
    
    Do NOT automatically generate or use plant images.
    
    For EVERY product block, provide:
    
    - Plant/Product Image → Shopify image picker
    - Shopify Product → Product selector
    - Product Link → URL option
    
    The merchant must be able to upload/replace every plant image directly from:
    
    Shopify Admin → Online Store → Theme Editor → Plant Product Carousel
    
    When an image is uploaded, automatically display it in the corresponding product card.
    
    Use the uploaded plant image as the primary visual asset without modifying, redesigning or replacing it.
    
    
    15. DYNAMIC PRODUCT OPTION
    
    Make the content editable.
    
    The merchant should be able to either:
    
    A. Select an actual Shopify product, in which case:
    - Product title
    - Price
    - Compare-at price
    - Product URL
    - Product image
    - Variant
    
    can optionally be pulled from Shopify,
    
    OR
    
    B. Use custom manual content through the Theme Editor:
    - Custom plant image
    - Custom title
    - Custom description
    - Custom price
    - Custom original price
    - Custom discount
    - Custom rating
    - Custom review count
    
    Add a setting such as:
    
    "Use Shopify Product Data" ON/OFF
    
    This makes the section flexible for the nursery website.
    
    
    16. VISUAL DETAILS FROM THE REFERENCE
    
    Match the product cards closely to the uploaded reference:
    
    - Large landscape image area at the top.
    - Product image should be centered.
    - Warm lifestyle-style image background can come from the uploaded product image.
    - White content area below the image.
    - Rounded card corners.
    - Small gap between cards.
    - Premium nursery/e-commerce appearance.
    - Dark green circular cart button.
    - Yellow BESTSELLER pill.
    - Red discount pill.
    - Rating badge with star icon.
    - Elegant bold plant name.
    - Clean description.
    - Price aligned toward the bottom-left.
    - Cart button aligned bottom-right.
    
    Do not add the human/person from the original reference design.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;background:#fff9e8;padding:48px 4%;overflow:hidden}.ai-plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{display:flex;gap:18px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;padding:8px 4px 18px;scrollbar-width:none}.ai-plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}.ai-plant-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}{flex:0 0 calc((100% - 36px)/3);min-width:260px;scroll-snap-align:start;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 16px #1f51301a;transition:transform .25s,box-shadow .25s}.ai-plant-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:0 12px 26px #1f513033}.ai-plant-card__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}{height:220px;background:#f4f7dc;position:relative}.ai-plant-card__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;transition:transform .3s}.ai-plant-card:hover img{transform:scale(1.03)}.ai-plant-card__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}{height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.ai-plant-card__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg{width:70%;height:70%;color:#1f5130}.ai-plant-pill-{{ ai_gen_id }}{position:absolute;top:14px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:20px;font:700 11px/1 Arial,sans-serif}.ai-plant-pill--best-{{ ai_gen_id }}{left:14px;background:#ffd60a;color:#14231a}.ai-plant-pill--discount-{{ ai_gen_id }}{right:14px;background:#c9342f;color:#fff}.ai-plant-card__body-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding:16px;position:relative;min-height:174px}.ai-plant-rating-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:inline-block;background:#f4f7dc;color:#1f5130;border-radius:12px;padding:5px 8px;font:600 12px Arial,sans-serif}.ai-plant-card h3{margin:12px 0 5px;color:#14231a;font:700 21px Georgia,serif}.ai-plant-card p{margin:0 0 18px;color:#5b6660;font:14px/1.4 Arial,sans-serif}.ai-plant-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:#1f5130;font:700 18px Arial,sans-serif}.ai-plant-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}{color:#8a918c;text-decoration:line-through;font-size:13px;font-weight:400}.ai-plant-cart-{{ ai_gen_id }}{position:absolute;right:16px;bottom:16px;width:42px;height:42px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:#1f5130;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer}.ai-plant-cart-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover{background:#0d3a1d;transform:scale(1.06)}.ai-plant-controls-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:10px;margin-top:8px}.ai-plant-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}{width:40px;height:40px;border:1px solid #1f5130;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;color:#1f5130;cursor:pointer;font-size:20px}.ai-plant-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}@media(max-width:990px){.ai-plant-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}{flex-basis:calc((100% - 18px)/2)}}@media(max-width:600px){.ai-plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding:32px 16px}.ai-plant-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}{flex-basis:86%}.ai-plant-card__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}{height:230px}}
{% endstyle %}
<plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="ai-plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track">
{% for i in (1..6) %}
{% liquid
assign enabled_key='product_' | append:i | append:'_enabled'
assign use_key='product_' | append:i | append:'_use_shopify'
assign image_key='product_' | append:i | append:'_image'
assign product_key='product_' | append:i | append:'_product'
assign title_key='product_' | append:i | append:'_title'
assign desc_key='product_' | append:i | append:'_description'
assign price_key='product_' | append:i | append:'_price'
assign compare_key='product_' | append:i | append:'_compare'
assign discount_key='product_' | append:i | append:'_discount'
assign rating_key='product_' | append:i | append:'_rating'
assign reviews_key='product_' | append:i | append:'_reviews'
assign badge_key='product_' | append:i | append:'_badge'
assign link_key='product_' | append:i | append:'_link'
assign enabled=block.settings[enabled_key]
assign selected=block.settings[product_key]
assign image=block.settings[image_key]
assign title=block.settings[title_key]
assign description=block.settings[desc_key]
assign price=block.settings[price_key]
assign compare=block.settings[compare_key]
assign discount=block.settings[discount_key]
assign rating=block.settings[rating_key]
assign reviews=block.settings[reviews_key]
assign badge=block.settings[badge_key]
assign link=block.settings[link_key]
if block.settings[use_key] and selected != blank
assign title=selected.title
assign description=selected.description | strip_html | truncate:90
assign price=selected.price | money
assign compare=selected.compare_at_price | money
assign image=selected.featured_image
assign link=selected.url
endif
%}
{% if enabled %}<article class="ai-plant-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><a href="{{ link | default:'#' }}"><div class="ai-plant-card__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{% if image %}<img src="{{ image | image_url:width:700 }}" alt="{{ title | escape }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}<div class="ai-plant-card__placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}{% if badge != blank %}<span class="ai-plant-pill-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-plant-pill--best-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ badge }}</span>{% endif %}{% if discount != blank %}<span class="ai-plant-pill-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-plant-pill--discount-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ discount }}</span>{% endif %}</div></a><div class="ai-plant-card__body-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><span class="ai-plant-rating-{{ ai_gen_id }}">★ {{ rating }} | {{ reviews }}</span><h3>{{ title }}</h3><p>{{ description }}</p><div class="ai-plant-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ price }} <span class="ai-plant-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ compare }}</span></div>{% if selected != blank %}<button type="button" class="ai-plant-cart-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-variant="{{ selected.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}" aria-label="Add {{ title | escape }} to cart">🛍</button>{% endif %}</div></article>{% endif %}
{% endfor %}</div><div class="ai-plant-controls-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><button class="ai-plant-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-direction="prev" aria-label="Previous products">‹</button><button class="ai-plant-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-direction="next" aria-label="Next products">›</button></div></plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(function(){class PlantCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.track=this.querySelector('.ai-plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track');this.querySelectorAll('[data-direction]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>this.track.scrollBy({left:(b.dataset.direction==='next'?1:-1)*this.track.clientWidth*.82,behavior:'smooth'})));this.querySelectorAll('[data-variant]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>fetch('/cart/add.js',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({items:[{id:b.dataset.variant,quantity:1}]})})));}}customElements.define('plant-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}',PlantCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }})})();</script>
